# Walkthrough - Legal Compliance & Audit Patch Implementation

We have audited and updated the **EduScholar** platform to comply with the **Republic Act No. 10173 (Data Privacy Act of 2012)** of the Philippines, WCAG 2.1 accessibility standards, and government web digital transparency standards.

---

## Key Revisions & Additions Implemented

### 1. New Legal & Governance Routes (Unauthenticated & Public)
- **[`PrivacyPolicyPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/pages/public/PrivacyPolicyPage.tsx)**: Detailed data governance policy under RA 10173 outlining Personal Data Collected, Processing Purpose, Data Retention, DPA Data Subject Rights, and DPO Contact Info (`dpo@quezoncity.gov.ph`). Accessible at `/privacy`.
- **[`TermsConditionsPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/pages/public/TermsConditionsPage.tsx)**: Official Government Portal Terms of Service covering QCitizen eligibility, authentic credential requirements under Revised Penal Code Art. 172, and 2FA credentials security. Accessible at `/terms`.
- **[`RefundPolicyPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/pages/public/RefundPolicyPage.tsx)**: Official statement disclosing all EduScholar application and portal services are **100% FREE OF CHARGE** under RA 11032 (Ease of Doing Business Act). Accessible at `/refund-policy`.
- **[`CookiePolicyPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/pages/public/CookiePolicyPage.tsx)**: Transparent breakdown of Essential Authentication cookies, Preference cookies, and explicit non-tracking declaration. Accessible at `/cookies`.

### 2. Cookie & Local Storage Consent Banner
- **[`CookieConsentBanner.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/components/common/CookieConsentBanner.tsx)**: Built an accessible, lightweight cookie consent banner mounted directly inside `App.tsx`. Allows users to accept essential or all cookies with local state saved in `localStorage`.

### 3. Unified Public Footer with Official Details
- **[`PublicFooter.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/components/layout/PublicFooter.tsx)**: Created a responsive footer with:
  - Official Quezon City Local Government Unit branding & address (Elliptical Road, Diliman, QC).
  - Official helpline contact info (Helpline 122 / support.edu2026@gmail.com).
  - Clickable links to `/privacy`, `/terms`, `/refund-policy`, and `/cookies`.

### 4. Registration Form DPA Consent Integration
- **[`RegisterPage.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/piama/EduScholar%20Revise/frontend/src/pages/auth/RegisterPage.tsx#L198-L215)**: Updated registration terms checkbox to explicitly link to `/terms` and `/privacy` for mandatory consent prior to account creation.

